       * Added a progress bar.\
       * Uses Alpine.js \cf3 x-data\cf2  to manage unique IDs per module (\cf3 module_id\cf2 ) and toggle between Video Upload and URL Input.\
       * Includes an inline script to initialize the uploader when a user interacts with the file input.\
\
   4. 
\f1\b Routes (`routes/web.php`)
