\cf3 > \cf4 "Phase 5.5: Bridging the Gap - Public Catalog & Enrollment System.\cf2 \
\
  \cf4 Context: We have courses (Phase 4) and video uploads (Phase 5), but no way for students to view or enroll in them. Phase 6 (Player)\cf2 \
  \cf4 requires active enrollment.\cf2 \
\
  \cf4 Action Required:\cf2 \
\
  \cf4 1. DATABASE UPDATE ('database/migrate_enrollments.php'):\cf2 \
  \cf4    - Ensure 'enrollments' table exists: (id, user_id, course_id, enrolled_at).\cf2 \
  \cf4    - If not, create it.\cf2 \
\
  \cf4 2. CONTROLLER ('app/Controllers/CourseController.php'):\cf2 \
  \cf4    - Method 'index()': Fetch all courses and render 'courses/index' (The Catalog).\cf2 \
  \cf4    - Method 'show($id)': Fetch course details + Module/Lesson list. Render 'courses/show' (Landing Page).\cf2 \
  \cf4    - Method 'enroll($id)': \cf2 \
  \cf4      * Check if user is logged in.\cf2 \
  \cf4      * Insert record into 'enrollments'.\cf2 \
  \cf4      * Redirect to '/learn/\{id\}' (The Player URL).\cf2 \
\
  \cf4 3. VIEWS:\cf2 \
  \cf4    - 'resources/views/courses/index.php': A Grid showing all courses (Thumbnail, Title, Price, 'View' Button).\cf2 \
  \cf4    - 'resources/views/courses/show.php': \cf2 \
  \cf4      * Hero Section: Title, Description, Thumbnail.\cf2 \
  \cf4      * Content List: Show modules/lessons titles (Read-only).\cf2 \
  \cf4      * CTA Button: \cf2 \
  \cf4        - If not enrolled -> 'Enroll Now' (POST to /course/\{id\}/enroll).\cf2 \
  \cf4        - If enrolled -> 'Continue Learning' (Link to /learn/\{id\}).\cf2 \
\
  \cf4 4. ROUTES ('routes/web.php'):\cf2 \
  \cf4    - GET '/courses' -> [CourseController::class, 'index'].\cf2 \
  \cf4    - GET '/course/\{id\}' -> [CourseController::class, 'show'].\cf2 \
  \cf4    - POST '/course/\{id\}/enroll' -> [CourseController::class, 'enroll'].\cf2 \
\
  \cf4 Provide the full code for the Controller and the two Views using the Dark Bento style."\cf2 \
