  \cf4 We are defining a robust Quiz Engine. Please implement the following Database Schema and Backend Logic.\cf2 \
\
  \cf4 1. DATABASE SCHEMA (SQLite Compatible):\cf2 \
  \cf4    \cf2 \
  \cf4    A. Table `quizzes` (The Settings Container):\cf2 \
  \cf4       - id (PK)\cf2 \
  \cf4       - lesson_id (FK -> lessons.id): Links this configuration to a specific lesson.\cf2 \
  \cf4       - time_limit (Integer): Minutes (0 = unlimited).\cf2 \
  \cf4       - passing_score (Integer): Percentage (e.g., 70).\cf2 \
  \cf4       - allowed_attempts (Integer): (0 = unlimited).\cf2 \
  \cf4       - is_randomized (Boolean): Shuffle questions?\cf2 \
  \cf4       - show_correct_answers (Boolean): Show feedback after submission?\cf2 \
  \cf4    \cf2 \
  \cf4    B. Table `questions` (The Content):\cf2 \
  \cf4       - id (PK)\cf2 \
  \cf4       - quiz_id (FK -> quizzes.id)\cf2 \
  \cf4       - type (Enum/Text): 'single_choice', 'multi_choice', 'true_false', 'short_text'.\cf2 \
  \cf4       - question_text (Text).\cf2 \
  \cf4       - media_url (Text, Nullable): Image/Audio for the question.\cf2 \
  \cf4       - points (Integer): Default 1.\cf2 \
  \cf4       - options (JSON): Stores choices. Example: [\{"id":1, "text":"Option A"\}, \{"id":2, "text":"Option B"\}]\cf2 \
  \cf4       - correct_answers (JSON): Stores correct IDs or text. Example: [1] or ["noun"].\cf2 \
  \cf4       - explanation (Text, Nullable): Feedback shown after answering.\cf2 \
\
  \cf4 2. INSTRUCTOR CONTROLLER (`QuizController`):\cf2 \
  \cf4    - Method `create($lessonId)`: If no quiz exists for this lesson, create one with default settings.\cf2 \
  \cf4    - Method `updateSettings($quizId)`: Update timer, pass score, attempts, etc.\cf2 \
  \cf4    - Method `addQuestion($quizId)`: Handle JSON payload to store question with options.\cf2 \
  \cf4    - Method `deleteQuestion($questionId)`.\cf2 \
\
  \cf4 3. VIEW (`instructor/quiz_builder.php`) - Dark Bento Style:\cf2 \
  \cf4    - Split Screen:\cf2 \
  \cf4      * LEFT Column: Quiz Settings Form (Timer, Passing Score, Toggles for Shuffle).\cf2 \
  \cf4      * RIGHT Column: Question Manager.\cf2 \
  \cf4        - 'Add Question' Button (Opens Modal/Accordion).\cf2 \
  \cf4        - Question Type Selector.\cf2 \
  \cf4        - Dynamic Inputs based on Type.\cf2 \
  \cf4        - List of added questions with 'Edit/Delete' actions.\cf2 \
\
  \cf4 4. MIGRATION SCRIPT:\cf2 \
  \cf4    - Create a script `database/migrate_quiz_engine.php` to generate these tables.\cf2 \
\
