   1. 
\f1\b Monetization
\f0\b0 : Support Paid vs. Free courses.\
   2. 
\f1\b Shopping Cart
\f0\b0 : Allow users to browse and enroll in multiple courses at once.\
   3. 
\f1\b Order History
\f0\b0 : Generate invoices/receipts for students.\
   4. 
\f1\b Financial Integrity
\f0\b0 : Record transactions, tax (optional), and payment statuses.\
\
  \cf14 ---\cf2 \
\
  
\f1\b 1. Database Architecture (The Commerce Schema)
\f0\b0 \
  We need new tables to handle the transaction lifecycle:\
\
   * 
\f1\b `orders`
\f0\b0 : The wrapper for a transaction.\
       * (\cf3 id\cf2 , \cf3 user_id\cf2 , \cf3 total_amount\cf2 , \cf3 status\cf2  ['pending', 'paid', 'failed'], \cf3 payment_method\cf2 , \cf3 created_at\cf2 ).\
   * 
\f1\b `order_items`
\f0\b0 : What did they buy?\
       * (\cf3 id\cf2 , \cf3 order_id\cf2 , \cf3 course_id\cf2 , \cf3 price_at_purchase\cf2 ).\
   * 
\f1\b `coupons`
\f0\b0  (The "Benefits"):\
       * (\cf3 id\cf2 , \cf3 code\cf2 , \cf3 discount_percent\cf2 , \cf3 valid_until\cf2 , \cf3 usage_limit\cf2 ).\
\
  
\f1\b 2. Backend Logic (The Commerce Engine)
\f0\b0 \
   * 
\f1\b CartController
\f0\b0 : Manage a session-based shopping cart (\cf3 add\cf2 , \cf3 remove\cf2 , \cf3 view\cf2 ).\
   * 
\f1\b CheckoutController
\f0\b0 :\
       * \cf3 summary()\cf2 : Review cart, enter coupon.\
       * \cf3 process()\cf2 : Create pending Order -> Initialize Payment.\
       * \cf3 webhook()\cf2 : Handle payment success (e.g., from Stripe) -> 
\f1\b Trigger Enrollment
\f0\b0 .\
   * 
\f1\b EnrollmentService Update
\f0\b0 : Only enroll the user 
\f2\i after
\f0\i0  the Order Status is 'paid'.\
\
  
\f1\b 3. User Experience (UX Upgrade)
\f0\b0 \
   * 
\f1\b Course Catalog
\f0\b0 :\
       * Change "Enroll Now" to 
\f1\b "Add to Cart"
\f0\b0  for paid courses.\
       * Keep "Enroll Now" for free courses.\
   * 
\f1\b Cart Modal/Page
\f0\b0 : A clean "Dark Bento" summary of selected items with a total price.\
   * 
\f1\b Checkout Flow
\f0\b0 : A professional invoice view before confirming.\
   * 
\f1\b My Orders
\f0\b0 : A new section in the Profile to view past purchases and receipts.\
\
  
\f1\b 4. Payment Gateway Strategy
\f0\b0 \
  For a professional system, we usually integrate 
\f1\b Stripe
\f0\b0 .\
   * 
\f2\i Option A (Simulation)
\f0\i0 : We build a "Mock Payment" gateway first to test the flow (Success/Fail) without needing API keys immediately.\
   * 
\f2\i Option B (Real)
\f0\i0 : We integrate the Stripe PHP SDK (requires \cf3 composer require stripe/stripe-php\cf2 ).\
\
