  \cf4    - On success, change the sidebar icon to \uc0\u9989  and show a 'Next Lesson' toast.\cf2 \
\
  \cf4 5. ROUTES ('routes/web.php'):\cf2 \
  \cf4    - GET '/learn/\{course_id\}/lesson/\{lesson_id\}' -> [LearnController::class, 'show'].\cf2 \
  \cf4    - POST '/track/progress' -> [LearnController::class, 'trackProgress'].\cf2 \
\
  \cf4 Provide full code for migration, controller, view, and JS tracker."\cf2 \
