   3. 
\f1\b Watch
\f0\b0 : Let a video play to the end.\
   4. 
\f1\b Verify
\f0\b0 : Refresh the page or go to the next lesson. The previous lesson in the sidebar should now have a green checkmark \uc0\u9989 .\
