\f1\b 1. For a New Course (Via Sidebar)
\f0\b0 \
   1. Look at the 
\f1\b Sidebar
\f0\b0  on the left side of your screen.\
   2. Click the link labeled 
\f1\b "Create Course"
\f0\b0  (with the plus icon).\
   3. Fill out the initial form (Title, Description, Price, Thumbnail).\
   4. Click 
\f1\b "Create Course & Continue \uc0\u55357 \u56960 "
\f0\b0 .\
   5. You will be 
\f1\b automatically redirected
\f0\b0  to the Course Builder for that new course.\
\
  
\f1\b 2. For an Existing Course (Via Dashboard)
\f0\b0 \
   1. Go to your 
\f1\b Dashboard
\f0\b0  (\cf3 /dashboard\cf2 ).\
   2. Scroll down to the section titled 
\f1\b "Teaching Dashboard"
\f0\b0 .\
   3. You will see a grid of all courses you have created.\
   4. Click the 
\f1\b "Manage Course"
\f0\b0  button on the course you wish to edit.\
\
  
