\f1\b Stateful Attempts
\f0\b0 : Handles creating new attempts or resuming incomplete ones seamlessly.\
   * 
\f1\b Context Loading
\f0\b0 : Fetches questions while stripping out the \cf3 correct_answers\cf2  to ensure the frontend is secure.\
