\f0\b0 \
   1. 
\f1\b Backend Logic
\f0\b0 : Added \cf3 myCourses()\cf2  to \cf3 CourseController.php\cf2  to fetch only the courses the user is currently enrolled in, along with their progress and completion status.\
   2. 
\f1\b View Created
\f0\b0 : \cf3 resources/views/courses/my_learning.php\cf2  provides a personal dashboard for students.\
       * 
\f1\b Progress Tracking
\f0\b0 : Each course card features a progress bar and percentage.\
       * 
\f1\b Smart Actions
\f0\b0 : Shows "Resume Learning" for active courses and "Review Course" for completed ones.\
       * 
\f1\b Empty State
\f0\b0 : Includes an "Explore Catalog" call-to-action if the student hasn't enrolled in any courses yet.\
   3. 
\f1\b Sidebar Fix
