\cf3 > \cf4 I want to enhance the functionality of the lessons; we won't be satisfied with just videos. Give me a developed and professional plan.\cf2 \
\
\cf3 \uc0\u10022  \cf2 This is a great strategic move. To make the LMS truly professional, we need to support 
\f1\b Rich Media
\f0\b0  and 
\f1\b Mixed Modalities
\f0\b0 . Relying solely on video uploads is expensive and limits\
  pedagogical flexibility.\
\
  Here is the 
\f1\b Phase 9: Advanced Content Engine
\f0\b0  plan.\
\
  
\f1\b \uc0\u55356 \u57263  The Objective
\f0\b0 \
  Introduce two new core capabilities:\
   1. 
\f1\b Rich Article Lessons
\f0\b0 : Markdown-based text lessons with code syntax highlighting (essential for technical courses) and inline images.\
   2. 
\f1\b Hybrid Resources
\f0\b0 : The ability to attach downloadable files (PDFs, Source Code, Zips) to 
\f2\i any
\f0\i0  lesson type (Video or Text).\
\
  \cf14 ---\cf2 \
\
  
\f1\b 1. Database Architecture
\f0\b0 \
  We need to expand the \cf3 lessons\cf2  table to hold text content and attachment data.\
\
  
\f1\b New Schema Changes:
\f0\b0 \
   * \cf3 type\cf2 : Add \cf3 'article'\cf2  to the enum.\
   * \cf3 content_text\cf2  (TEXT, Nullable): Stores the Markdown body for Article lessons.\
   * \cf3 attachment_url\cf2  (TEXT, Nullable): Path to a downloadable file (e.g., \cf3 /uploads/resources/slide.pdf\cf2 ).\
   * \cf3 video_provider\cf2  (TEXT, Nullable): \cf3 'local'\cf2 , \cf3 'youtube'\cf2 , \cf3 'vimeo'\cf2  (To future-proof embedding).\
\
  
\f1\b 2. Instructor Experience (The Builder Upgrade)
\f0\b0 \
  We will overhaul the "Add Lesson" form in \cf3 course_builder.php\cf2  into a 
\f1\b Tabbed Interface
\f0\b0 :\
\
   * 
\f1\b Tab A: Video
\f0\b0 :\
       * Existing Chunked Uploader.\
       * 
\f2\i New
\f0\i0 : Toggle for "External Link" (YouTube/Vimeo) to save server storage.\
   * 
\f1\b Tab B: Article (New)
\f0\b0 :\
       * Integrate 
\f1\b EasyMDE
\f0\b0  (A lightweight, dark-mode friendly Markdown Editor).\
       * Allows Headers, Lists, Bold/Italic, and Code Blocks.\
   * 
\f1\b Global Settings (All Types)
\f0\b0 :\
       * 
\f1\b Attachment Uploader
\f0\b0 : "Upload Resource (PDF/Zip)".\
\
  
\f1\b 3. Student Experience (The Player Upgrade)
\f0\b0 \
  The Player (\cf3 learn/player.php\cf2 ) must adapt dynamically:\
\
   * 
\f1\b Video Mode
\f0\b0 :\
       * If Local: HTML5 Player (Existing).\
       * If YouTube: Responsive Iframe Embed.\
       * 
\f2\i New
\f0\i0 : A "Resources" tab/button below the video to download attached files.\
   * 
\f1\b Article Mode
\f0\b0 :\
       * Renders Markdown as HTML (using a library like \cf3 Parsedown\cf2 ).\
       * 
\f1\b Syntax Highlighting
\f0\b0 : Integrate 
\f1\b Prism.js
\f0\b0  so code blocks look like a professional IDE (VS Code style).\
       * Clean typography (Prose styling) for readability.\
\
  \cf14 ---\cf2 \
