\cf3 > \cf4 Develop a professional, phased plan to implement the following:\cf2 \
  \cf4 - We will move course browsing and purchase from the dashboard to the website itself.\cf2 \
  \cf4 - We will add the Cart feature outside the dashboard.\cf2 \
  \cf4 - The dashboard will then be solely for managing courses and their settings, browsing existing courses, or creating new ones, and will no longer be a page for displaying courses.\cf2 \
\
\cf3 \uc0\u10022  \cf2 This is a significant architectural pivot that aligns with best practices: separating the 
\f1\b Marketing Site (Public)
\f0\b0  from the 
\f1\b Application App (Private)
\f0\b0 .\
\
  Here is the 
\f1\b Phase 11: Public/Private Separation Plan
\f0\b0 .\
\
  
\f1\b \uc0\u55356 \u57303  Architecture
\f0\b0 \
   * 
\f1\b Public Site (No Login Required)
\f0\b0 :\
       * \cf3 /\cf2 : Home\
       * \cf3 /courses\cf2 : Public Catalog\
       * \cf3 /course/\{id\}\cf2 : Public Landing Page\
       * \cf3 /cart\cf2 : Public Shopping Cart (Session-based)\
       * \cf3 /checkout\cf2 : Secure Checkout (Requires Login 
\f2\i during
\f0\i0  flow)\
   * 
\f1\b Private App (Login Required)
\f0\b0 :\
       * \cf3 /dashboard\cf2 : User's Learning Center & Instructor Tools.\
       * \cf3 /learn/...\cf2 : The actual Course Player.\
       * \cf3 /instructor/...\cf2 : Course Building Tools.\
\
  \cf14 ---\cf2 \
\
  
\f1\b \uc0\u55357 \u56517  Phased Execution
\f0\b0 \
\
  
\f2\i \cf4 Phase 11.1: Layout Separation
\f0\i0 \cf2 \
  We need two distinct layouts.\
   * \cf3 layouts/public.php\cf2 : Navigation includes "Home", "Catalog", "Cart", "Login". Footer includes links. Darker, marketing-focused.\
   * \cf3 layouts/app.php\cf2  (Existing): Sidebar navigation. Focused on tools. "Back to Site" link.\
\
  
\f2\i \cf4 Phase 11.2: Controller Refactoring
\f0\i0 \cf2 \
   * 
\f1\b CourseController
\f0\b0 :\
       * \cf3 index\cf2  (Catalog) & \cf3 show\cf2  (Landing) -> Move to use \cf3 layouts/public\cf2 .\
       * \cf3 myCourses\cf2  -> Stays in \cf3 layouts/app\cf2  (This effectively becomes the new Dashboard "Student View").\
   * 
\f1\b CartController
\f0\b0 : Move to \cf3 layouts/public\cf2 .\
   * 
\f1\b DashboardController
\f0\b0 :\
       * 
\f1\b REMOVE
\f0\b0  "Browse Courses" button.\
       * 
\f1\b REMOVE
\f0\b0  "My Learning" logic (Move this to be the 
\f2\i primary
\f0\i0  dashboard view).\
       * Basically, the Dashboard 
\f2\i is
\f0\i0  "My Learning" + "Instructor Tools".\
\
  
\f2\i \cf4 Phase 11.3: The "Enrolled" Bridge
\f0\i0 \cf2 \
   * If a user visits a Public Landing Page for a course they 
\f2\i already own
\f0\i0 , the "Enroll" button becomes "Go to Dashboard".\
   * If they buy a course, the "Thank You" page guides them: "Go to Dashboard to Start Learning".\
\
  
\f2\i \cf4 Phase 11.4: Dashboard Redesign
\f0\i0 \cf2 \
   * Since browsing is gone, the Dashboard needs a new purpose.\
   * 
\f1\b Top Section
\f0\b0 : "Jump back in" (Last active lesson).\
   * 
\f1\b Main Grid
\f0\b0 : All Enrolled Courses (Progress Bars).\
   * 
\f1\b Sidebar
\f0\b0 : "Instructor Mode" toggle (if eligible).\
\
  \cf14 ---\cf2 \
