\
  
\f2\i \cf4 3. Instructor Interface (\cf3 InstructorController\cf4 , \cf3 student_activity.php\cf4 )
\f0\i0 \cf2 \
   * 
\f1\b Logic
\f0\b0 : Fetch pending requests for the student in \cf3 studentActivity()\cf2 .\
   * 
\f1\b UI
\f0\b0 : Add a "Reset Requests" alert box at the top of the Activity page if pending.\
   * 
\f1\b Action
\f0\b0 :\
       * 
\f1\b Approve
\f0\b0 : \cf3 POST /instructor/request/approve/\{id\}\cf2 \
           * 
\f1\b Action
\f0\b0 : Deletes ALL rows in \cf3 quiz_attempts\cf2  for that user/quiz. Updates request status to \cf3 approved\cf2 .\
       * 
\f1\b Reject
\f0\b0 : \cf3 POST /instructor/request/reject/\{id\}\cf2  -> Updates status to \cf3 rejected\cf2 .\
\
  
